⍝ ==== s2 code generation (spec §13): stack-to-SSA and LLVM IR, line for line as s1's emit.uh
⍝ Runs on the heap the check pass leaves. Registers: 26 next %t, 27 next L,
⍝ 28 the IR lines (a queue of strings), 29 the globals, 30 the current label,
⍝ 31 the future-call frames (a stack of [below calls]), 32 the failure return
⍝ (−1: none), 33 next string constant, 34 debug, 35 hoisted post-selections,
⍝ 36 functions (a queue of [name sym ffi f node ops0 ops1]), 41 … 48 the texts
⍝ "i8" "i64" "double" "ptr" "i1" "true" "false" "0".
⍝ An entry of the virtual stack is [ty v ok role hasc c lit slots live neg cmp]:
⍝ v and ok are SSA texts (−1: none), c a known value when hasc is 1, slots,
⍝ live and neg the lists of a superposition, cmp the [eq gt lt a b] of a fresh ≶.

⍝ ---- IR text

⍝ ‹eraw› C s: a line as it is
⦃ ⧖:C,s ⧗:C #28# ‹reg› ⧖:C,q ⧗:C,q,s ‹qadd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹eraw› ⸫
⍝ ‹eemit› C s: an indented line
⦃ ⧖:C,s ⧗:C %%  {s}%% ⧖:C,l ⧗:C,l ‹eraw› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹eemit› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,s ⧗:C,s ‹eemit› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹eem› ⸫
⍝ ‹estart› C lbl: start the block lbl
⦃ ⧖:C,lbl ⧗:C %%{lbl}:%% ⧖:C,l ⧗:C,l ‹eraw› #30# ⧗:lbl ‹wr› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹estart› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C ⧗:C #26# ‹inc› △ ⊞ ⧖:C,n ⧗:C %%!%t{#n}%% ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹etmp› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C ⧗:C #27# ‹inc› △ ⊞ ⧖:C,n ⧗:C %%!L{#n}%% ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹elabel› ⸫
⍝ ‹edef› C rhs: %t = rhs, giving %t
⦃ ⧖:C,rhs ⧗:C ‹etmp› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C %%{t} = {rhs}%% ⧖:C,l ⧗:C,l ‹eemit› ⧗:t ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹edef› ⸫
⍝ ‹ebr› C l: br label %l
⦃ ⧖:C,l ⧗:C %%br label %{l}%% ‹eemit› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebr› ⸫
⍝ ‹ebr2› C c a b: br i1 c, label %a, label %b
⦃ ⧖:C,c,a,b ⧗:C %%br i1 {c}, label %{a}, label %{b}%% ‹eemit› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebr2› ⸫
⍝ ‹ecur› C: the current label
⦃ #30# ‹reg› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ecur› ⸫
⍝ ‹etx› C r: the text in register r (41 i8 … 48 0)
⦃ ‹reg› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹etx› ⸫

⍝ ‹eerr› C tok: start an error message at tok (−1: the file)
⦃ ‹cerr› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹eerr› ⸫

⍝ ---- types

⍝ ‹tcode› C t: 0 ŧ, 1 ℤ, 2 ℝ, 3 𝔹, 4 ʃ, 5 ◌, 6 "", 7 ◌T, 8 ⟦T⟧, 9 ⟗T or ⟖T, 10 a particle, 11 other
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t #10# ‹tis› ⧖:C,a ⧗:C,t #11# ‹tis› ⧖:C,b ⧗:C,t #12# ‹tis› ⧖:C,c ⧗:C,t #13# ‹tis› ⧖:C,d
  ⧗:C,t #14# ‹tis› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C,t #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C,t #16# ‹tis› ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C,t ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C,t ‹ptfind› ⧖:C,p
  ⧗:C #11# ⧗:p #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #10# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:h #10199# ᛖ ⧗:h #10198# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #9# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:h #10214# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #8# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:h #9676# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #7# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:g ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #6# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:f ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #5# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:e ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #4# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:d ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:b ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:a ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tcode› ⸫

⍝ ‹ellty› C t: the LLVM type of t, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t ‹tcode› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C,t,k
  ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⍿¹ #3# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #41# ‹etx› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #42# ‹etx› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #43# ‹etx› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⍿¹ #8# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #44# ‹etx› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #45# ‹etx› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹ellfail› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹ellref› ⦄ ⦃
  #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ptfind› ‹ellty› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ellty› ⸫
⍝ ◌T: {T, i1}
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t ‹stail› ‹ellty› ⧖:C,inner
  ⧗:C,inner ⧗:inner #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:i %%!{{{i}, i1}}%% ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ellfail› ⸫
⍝ ⟗T, ⟖T: T itself when T is classical, else a pointer
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t ‹stail› ⧖:C,inner
  ⧗:C,inner ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
  ⧗:C,inner ⧗:cp ⋔ ⦃ ‹ellty› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #44# ‹etx› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ellref› ⸫

⍝ ‹estrip› C t: t without a leading ⟗ or ⟖
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C,t ⧗:h #10199# ᛖ ⧗:h #10198# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ‹stail› ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹estrip› ⸫

⍝ ‹eelem› C t: the element type of a string or array type (shadows allowed)
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t ‹estrip› ⧖:C,b
  ⧗:C,b #14# ‹tis› ⧖:C,s
  ⧗:C,b ⧗:s ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #13# ‹reg› ⦄ ⦃ △ ‹elemof› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eelem› ⸫

⍝ ‹esize› C lt: the byte size of an element of LLVM type lt, as text
⦃
  ⧖:C,lt
  ⧗:C #41# ‹etx› ⧖:C,i8 ⧗:C #45# ‹etx› ⧖:C,i1
  ⧗:C ⧗:lt ⧗:i8 ᛖ ⧗:lt ⧗:i1 ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ #49# ⦄ ⦃ #56# ⦄ ⁼ ‹str1›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹esize› ⸫

⍝ ‹ezero› C lt: the zero of LLVM type lt
⦃
  ⧖:C,lt
  ⧗:C #43# ‹etx› ⧖:C,dbl ⧗:C #44# ‹etx› ⧖:C,ptr
  ⧗:C,lt ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  #3# ⧗:h #123# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:lt ⧗:ptr ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:lt ⧗:dbl ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:k
  ⧗:C,k ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ %%!0.0%% ⦄ ⦃ ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ %%!null%% ⦄ ⦃ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ %%!zeroinitializer%% ⦄ ⦃ #48# ‹etx› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ezero› ⸫

⍝ ‹eneed› C t tok: t must have an LLVM type (§13)
⦃
  ⧖:C,t,tok
  ⧗:C,t ‹ellty› ⧖:C,lt
  ⧗:C,t ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C,tok,t,h ⧗:lt #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:tk,ty,hh ⧗:tk ‹eerr› ⧗:ty ⧗:hh #968# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $s1 keeps superpositions inside one block: $ ⎙̵ ‹spr› $ cannot be a parameter or a result$ ⎙̵ ⦄
        ⦃ $code generation for $ ⎙̵ ‹spr› $ is not supported in s1$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼ ‹die› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹eneed› ⸫

⍝ ---- entries

⦃
  ⧖:C,ty,v,ok,role,hasc,c,lit,sl,lv,ng,cmp
  ⧗:C ‹len› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C ⧗:ty ⍆̵ ⧗:v ⍆̵ ⧗:ok ⍆̵ ⧗:role ⍆̵ ⧗:hasc ⍆̵ ⧗:c ⍆̵ ⧗:lit ⍆̵ ⧗:sl ⍆̵ ⧗:lv ⍆̵ ⧗:ng ⍆̵ ⧗:cmp ⍆̵ ⧗:e
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹entx› ⸫
⍝ ‹ent› C ty v ok
⦃ ⧖:C,ty,v,ok ⧗:C,ty,v,ok #-1# ○ ○ ○ #-1# #-1# #-1# #-1# ‹entx› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ent› ⸫
⍝ ‹entc› C ty v c lit: an entry with a known value
⦃ ⧖:C,ty,v,c,lit ⧗:C,ty,v #-1# #-1# △ ⧗:c,lit #-1# #-1# #-1# #-1# ‹entx› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹entc› ⸫
⍝ ‹ewrole› C e role: e with that role (s1's em_with_role: no literal mark, no comparison)
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,role
  ⧗:C,e ○ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ty ⧗:C,e △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,v ⧗:C,e #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ok
  ⧗:C,e #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,hc ⧗:C,e #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,c
  ⧗:C,e #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,sl ⧗:C,e #8# ‹vf› ⧖:C,lv ⧗:C,e #9# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ng
  ⧗:C,ty,v,ok,role,hc,c ○ ⧗:sl,lv,ng #-1# ‹entx›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ewrole› ⸫
⦃ ○ ‹vf› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ety› ⸫
⦃ △ ‹vf› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ev› ⸫
⦃ #2# ‹vf› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eok› ⸫

⍝ ‹efailty› C t: t is ◌T (or ◌)
⦃ ‹shead› #9676# ᛖ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹efailty› ⸫
⍝ ‹evty› C t: the LLVM type of the v part (◌T → T), −1 for a bare ◌
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,bare ⧗:C,t ‹efailty› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C,t,f ⧗:bare ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⦃ ⋔ ⦃ ‹stail› ‹ellty› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ellty› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evty› ⸫

⍝ ---- future (deferred) calls and failure exits

⍝ ‹epushf› C: a new frame
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C ‹qnew› ⧖:C,q ⧗:C #31# ‹reg› ⧖:C,below
  ⧗:C ‹len› ⧖:C,fr ⧗:C ⧗:below ⍆̵ ⧗:q ⍆̵ #31# ⧗:fr ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹epushf› ⸫
⍝ ‹epopf› C: remove the top frame, giving its calls
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C #31# ‹reg› ⧖:C,fr
  ⧗:C,fr ‹rd› ⧖:C,below ⧗:C ⧗:fr △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,q
  ⧗:C #31# ⧗:below ‹wr› ⧗:q
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹epopf› ⸫
⍝ ‹erunf› C q: emit a frame's calls, last in first out
⦃
  ⧖:C,q
  ⧗:C,q ‹qlist› ⧖:C,L
  ⧗:C,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,L ⧗:n △ ⊟
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,i
    ⧗:C,L,i ⧗:i ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:LL,ii ⧗:LL,ii ‹lget› ‹eemit› ⧗:LL ⧗:ii △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:LL,ii ⧗:LL,ii ‹lget› ‹eemit› ⧗:LL ⧗:ii △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹erunf› ⸫
⍝ ‹efailexit› C: leave the function by failure, running every pending future call, innermost first
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C #31# ‹reg› ⧖:C,fr
  ⧗:C,fr
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,fr
    ⧗:C,fr ⧗:fr #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:C,fr ⧗:C ⧗:fr △ ⊞ ‹rd› ‹erunf› ⧗:fr ‹rd› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁
  #32# ‹reg› ⧖:C,fret
  ⧗:C,fret ⧗:fret #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ %%call void @trith_loop_failed()%% ‹eemit› %%unreachable%% ‹eemit› ⦄ ⦃ ‹eemit› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹efailexit› ⸫

⍝ ‹eunwrap› C e: ◌T used as T: branch out by failure, continue with the value (§7.3)
⦃
  ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C,e ‹ety› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t ‹efailty› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C,t #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,bare
  ⧗:C,e,t ⧗:f ‹not› ⧗:bare ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹eunwrap1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eunwrap› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,t
  ⧗:C ‹elabel› ⧖:C,lc ⧗:C ‹elabel› ⧖:C,lf
  ⧗:C,e ‹eok› ⧖:C,ok
  ⧗:C,ok,lc,lf ‹ebr2›
  ⧗:lf ‹estart› ‹efailexit› ⧗:lc ‹estart›
  ⧗:t ‹stail› ⧖:C,bt ⧗:C,e ‹ev› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C,bt,v #-1# ‹ent›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eunwrap1› ⸫

⍝ ‹epop› C S k: S without its top k, and those k ordered by case role (§6)
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,k
  ⧗:C,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,S ○ ⧗:n ⧗:k ⊟ ‹lslice› ⧖:C,S2
  ⧗:C,S ⧗:n ⧗:k ⊟ ⧗:n ‹lslice› ⧖:C,vals
  ⍝ k free slots
  ⧗:C ‹lbeg› ⧖:C,sl
  ⧗:C,sl ⧗:k ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:C,sl,j ⧗:C,sl,j ○ ⧗:j ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:C,sl,j ⧗:C,sl #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:sl ⧗:j △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄ ⦄ ⌁ ⧖:C,sl
  ⍝ first the values with a role, then the others in the free slots
  ⧗:C,vals,sl ○ ⧗:k
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,vals,sl,i,k
    ⧗:C,vals,sl,i,k ⧗:i ⧗:k ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,vals,sl,i,k ⧗:C,vals,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,v ⧗:C,v #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,r
        ⧗:C,sl,r,v ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹lset› ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:vals,sl ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:k ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C,vals,sl ○ ⧗:k
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,vals,sl,i,k
    ⧗:C,vals,sl,i,k ⧗:i ⧗:k ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,vals,sl,i,k ⧗:C,vals,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,v ⧗:C,v #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,r
        ⧗:C,sl,v ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹epfree› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:vals,sl ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:k ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C,S2,sl
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹epop› ⸫
⍝ ‹epfree› C sl v: put v in the first free slot
⦃
  ⧖:C,sl,v
  ⧗:C,sl ○
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:C,sl,j ⧗:C,sl,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,x ⧗:C,sl,j ⧗:x #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ⧖:C,sl,j ⧗:C,sl,j,v ‹lset›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹epfree› ⸫

⍝ ---- packing values for calls and returns

⍝ ‹epack› C e o: entry e (−1: none) as a value of declared type o
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,o
  ⧗:C,o #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,bare ⧗:C,o ‹efailty› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C,e,o,f ⧗:bare ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⍿⁰ #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #46# ‹etx› ⦄ ⦃ ‹eok› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⦃ ⋔ ⦃ ‹epack1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ‹ev› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹epack› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,o
  ⧗:C,o ‹ellty› ⧖:C,st ⧗:C,o ‹stail› ‹ellty› ⧖:C,it
  ⧗:C,e ‹ev› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C,e ‹ety› ‹efailty› ⧖:C,ef
  ⧗:C,e ⧗:ef ⋔ ⦃ ‹eok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #46# ‹etx› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,ok
  ⧗:C %%insertvalue {st} undef, {it} {v}, 0%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,s1
  ⧗:C %%insertvalue {st} {s1}, i1 {ok}, 1%% ‹edef›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹epack1› ⸫

⍝ ‹eunpack› C o r: value r of declared type o as an entry
⦃
  ⧖:C,o,r
  ⧗:C,o #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,bare ⧗:C,o ‹efailty› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C,o,r,f ⧗:bare ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:oo,rr ⧗:oo #-1# ⧗:rr ‹ent› ⦄ ⦃ ⋔ ⦃ ‹eunpack1› ⦄ ⦃ #-1# ‹ent› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eunpack› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,o,r
  ⧗:C,o ‹ellty› ⧖:C,st
  ⧗:C %%extractvalue {st} {r}, 0%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C %%extractvalue {st} {r}, 1%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,ok
  ⧗:C,o,v,ok ‹ent›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eunpack1› ⸫

⍝ ‹eretty› C outs: the return type of a function with outputs outs
⦃
  ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,outs,n ⧗:n ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ %%!void%% ⦄ ⦃ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ○ ‹lget› ‹ellty› ⦄ ⦃ ‹eretty1› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eretty› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C,outs ‹etypes› ⧖:C,q
  ⧗:C,q ○ ‹qjoin› ⧖:C,body
  ⧗:C %%!{{{body}}}%%
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eretty1› ⸫
⍝ ‹etypes› C L: a queue of the LLVM types of the types in L
⦃
  ⧖:C,L
  ⧗:C ‹qnew› ⧖:C,q
  ⧗:C,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,L,q ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,q,i,n
    ⧗:C,L,q,i,n ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,L,q,i,n ⧗:C,L,i ‹lget› ‹ellty› ⧖:C,lt ⧗:C,q,lt ‹qadd› ⧗:L,q ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:q ⌁ ⧗:q
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹etypes› ⸫

⍝ ---- calls

⍝ ‹ecall› C S f fut: call the function with emit record f (fut: a future call)
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,f,fut
  ⧗:C,f #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,fr
  ⧗:C,fr △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ins ⧗:C,fr #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C,f △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,sym ⧗:C,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ffi
  ⧗:C,ins ‹llen› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C,S,k ‹epop› ⧖:C,S2,vals
  ⧗:C ‹qnew› ⧖:C,args
  ⧗:C,vals,ins,args ○ ⧗:k
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,vals,ins,args,i,k
    ⧗:C,vals,ins,args,i,k ⧗:i ⧗:k ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹ecarg› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,vals,ins,args,i,k
  ⧗:C,args ○ ‹qjoin› ⧖:C,at
  ⧗:C,outs ‹eretty› ⧖:C,rt
  ⧗:C,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,no
  ⧗:C,outs ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,o0
  ⧗:C,o0 ‹efailty› ⧖:C,of
  ⧗:ffi △ ᛖ ⧗:no △ ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:of ⋎ ⧖:isffi
  ⧗:C,S2,o0,sym,at,rt,outs,no,fut ⧗:isffi ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ‹ecffi› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ecall2› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ecall› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,vals,ins,args,i,k
  ⧗:C,vals,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C,ins,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,want
  ⧗:C,want ‹efailty› ⧖:C,wf
  ⧗:C,e ⧗:wf ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ‹eunwrap› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,e2
  ⧗:C,want ‹ellty› ⧖:C,lt
  ⧗:C,e2,want ‹epack› ⧖:C,pv
  ⧗:C %%{lt} {pv}%% ⧖:C,a ⧗:C,args,a ‹qadd›
  ⧗:vals,ins,args ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:k
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹ecarg› ⸫
⍝ ‹effibase› C o: the C-side type of an FFI result
⦃
  ⧖:C,o
  ⧗:C,o #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,bare ⧗:C,o ‹efailty› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C,o,f ⧗:bare ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #11# ‹reg› ⦄ ⦃ ⋔ ⦃ ‹stail› ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹effibase› ⸫
⍝ an FFI call returning ◌T: the C result says whether it failed
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,o,sym,at
  ⧗:C,o ‹effibase› ⧖:C,base ⧗:C,base ‹ellty› ⧖:C,blt
  ⧗:C %%call {blt} {sym}({at})%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,raw
  ⧗:C #44# ‹etx› ⧖:C,ptr ⧗:C #43# ‹etx› ⧖:C,dbl
  #2# ⧗:blt ⧗:dbl ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:blt ⧗:ptr ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:kk
  ⧗:C,blt,raw,kk ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:b,r %%icmp ne ptr {r}, null%% ⦄
    ⦃ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:b,r %%fcmp ord double {r}, 0.0%% ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:b,r %%icmp sge {b} {r}, 0%% ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ‹edef› ⧖:C,ok
  ⧗:C,o #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,bare
  ⧗:raw ⧗:bare ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:v
  ⧗:C,o,v,ok ‹ent› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C,S,e ‹lpush›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ecffi› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,o0,sym,at,rt,outs,no,fut
  ⧗:C %%call {rt} {sym}({at})%% ⧖:C,ct
  ⧗:C,S,ct,o0,rt,outs,no ⧗:fut ⋔ ⦃ ‹ecfut› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ecall3› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ecall2› ⸫
⍝ a future call joins the innermost frame
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,ct,o0,rt,outs,no
  ⧗:C #31# ‹reg› ⧖:C,fr ⧗:C ⧗:fr △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,q ⧗:C,q,ct ‹qadd› ⧗:S
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ecfut› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,ct,o0,rt,outs,no
  ⧗:C,S,ct,o0,rt,outs,no ⧗:no ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:s,c ⧗:c ‹eemit› ⧗:s ⦄ ⦃ ‹ecall4› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ecall3› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,ct,o0,rt,outs,no
  ⧗:C,ct ‹edef› ⧖:C,r
  ⧗:C,S,o0,r,rt,outs,no ⧗:no △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:SS,oo,rr ⧗:oo,rr ‹eunpack› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C,SS,e ‹lpush› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ecallm› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ecall4› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,o0,r,rt,outs,no
  ⧗:C,S,r,rt,outs ○ ⧗:no
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,S,r,rt,outs,i,n
    ⧗:C,S,r,rt,outs,i,n ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,S,r,rt,outs,i,n
        ⧗:C %%extractvalue {rt} {r}, {#i}%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,part
        ⧗:C,outs,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,o ⧗:C,o,part ‹eunpack› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C,S,e ‹lpush› ⧖:C,S2
        ⧗:C,S2,r,rt,outs ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,S,r,rt,outs,i,n ⧗:C,S
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ecallm› ⸫

⍝ ---- string literals

⍝ ‹ehexd› d: the code point of hex digit d
⦃ ⧖:d ⧗:d #48# ⊞ ⧗:d #9# ≶ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ #7# ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹ehexd› ⸫
⍝ ‹ebyte› C e b c: one byte b of the code point c, as written in an LLVM c"…" string
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,b,c
  ⧗:b #32# #126# ᛦ ⧗:c #34# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:c #92# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⧖:plain
  ⧗:C,e,b,c ⧗:plain ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:ee,bb,cc ⧗:ee,cc ‹scp› ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:ee,bb,cc ⧗:ee #92# ‹scp› ⧗:ee ⧗:bb #4# ≫ ‹ehexd› ‹scp› ⧗:ee ⧗:bb #15# ⋒ ‹ehexd› ‹scp› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebyte› ⸫
⍝ ‹eutf8› C e c: the UTF-8 bytes of c; their number
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,c
  #4# ⧗:c #65536# ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ⧗:c #2048# ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ⧗:c #128# ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ⧖:m
  ⍝ lead byte, then continuation bytes from the highest
  ⧗:c,m ⧗:m △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:cc,mm #255# #8# ⧗:mm ⊟ ≪ #255# ⋒ ⧗:cc #6# ⧗:mm △ ⊟ ⊠ ≫ ⋓ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:lead
  ⧗:C,e,lead,c ‹ebyte›
  ⧗:e,c ⧗:m #2# ⊟
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:e,c,j
    ⧗:e,c,j ○ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:ee,cc,jj ⧗:ee #128# ⧗:cc #6# ⧗:jj ⊠ ≫ #63# ⋒ ⋓ ⧗:cc ‹ebyte› ⧗:ee,cc ⧗:jj △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:m
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eutf8› ⸫
⍝ ‹estring› C t: a global constant for the text of string token t: its name and length
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C #33# ‹inc› △ ⊞ ⧖:C,sn
  ⧗:C %%!@.s{#sn}%% ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C,e ○ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,nb,j,end
    ⧗:C,e,nb,j,end ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,nb,j,end ⧗:C,j ‹rd› ⧖:C,c ⧗:C,e,c ‹eutf8› ⧖:C,m ⧗:C,e ⧗:nb ⧗:m ⊞ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,e,nb,j,end
  ⧗:C %%{name} = private unnamed_addr constant [{#nb} x i8] c"{e}"%% ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C #29# ‹reg› ⧖:C,q ⧗:C,q,g ‹qadd› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C %%!{#nb}%% ⧖:C,len
  ⧗:C,name,len
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹estring› ⸫

⍝ ---- containers: ʃ and ⟦T⟧ share the layout { ptr data, i64 len, i64 cap }

⍝ ‹efield› C a k: load field k (0 data, 1 len)
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,k
  ⧗:C,a,k ⧗:k ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:aa %%load ptr, ptr {aa}, !tbaa !5%% ‹edef› ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:aa,kk %%getelementptr inbounds %trith.arr, ptr {aa}, i32 0, i32 {#kk}%% ‹edef› ⧖:p %%load i64, ptr {p}, !tbaa !4%% ‹edef› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹efield› ⸫
⍝ ‹epos› C a i: the centre-based position i + len/2 (§11) and whether it is inside
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,i
  ⧗:C,a △ ‹efield› ⧖:C,ln
  ⧗:C %%lshr i64 {ln}, 1%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,half
  ⧗:C %%add i64 {i}, {half}%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,pos
  ⧗:C %%icmp ult i64 {pos}, {ln}%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,ok
  ⧗:C,pos,ok
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹epos› ⸫
⍝ ‹elevels› C t: how deep quantum elements nest inside container type t; −1 if unsupported
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t #14# ‹tis› ⧖:C,s
  ⧗:C,t ⧗:s ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⦃ ‹elevels1› ⦄ ⁼
