  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t ‹eelem› ⧖:C,el
  ⧗:C,el ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
  ⧗:C,el #14# ‹tis› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C,el ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:s ⧗:h #10214# ᛖ ⋏ ⧖:nest
  ⧗:C,el,nest ⧗:cp ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⦃ ⋔ ⦃ ‹elevels› ⍿⁰ #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹elevels1› ⸫

⍝ ---- operators (§18): ‹eglyph› C tok vals → C L, the entries to push

⦃ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⟨ŧ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹yn› ⸫
⍝ ‹gf› C g k: field k of the operand record [tok vals ty a b lt real byte x ea]
⦃ ‹vf› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹gf› ⸫
⦃ ‹vf› △ ᛖ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹gflag› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,vals
  ⧗:C,tok ‹tc0› ⧖:C,x
  ⧗:C,vals ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,ea
  ⧗:C,ea ‹ety› ⧖:C,ty ⧗:C,ea ‹ev› ⧖:C,a
  ⧗:C,vals ‹llen› ⧖:C,nv
  ⧗:C,vals ⧗:nv △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⦃ △ ‹lget› ‹ev› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⧖:C,b
  ⧗:C,ty ‹evty› ⧖:C,lt
  ⧗:C,ty #12# ‹tis› ⧖:C,real ⧗:C,ty #13# ‹tis› ⧖:C,byte
  ⧗:C ‹len› ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C ⧗:tok ⍆̵ ⧗:vals ⍆̵ ⧗:ty ⍆̵ ⧗:a ⍆̵ ⧗:b ⍆̵ ⧗:lt ⍆̵ ⧗:real ‹yn› ⍆̵ ⧗:byte ‹yn› ⍆̵ ⧗:x ⍆̵ ⧗:ea ⍆̵
  ⧗:g,x
  ⍿⁰ ⧖ @any(8862,8863,8864)@ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_arith› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ ⧖ @any(8856,8860)@ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_div› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8861# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_neg› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8822# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_cmp› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ ⧖ @any(8911,8910)@ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_tmin› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ ⧖ @any(8914,8915,10849,8810,8811)@ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_bits› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #9863# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_neut› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8961# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_drop› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #9113# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_print› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #9076# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹eg_len› ⦄ ⦃
