  ⧗:C,tok,base ⧗:lv #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:tk,b ⧗:tk ‹eerr› $code generation for ⌁ on $ ⎙̵ ⧗:b ‹spr› $ (elements with antiparticles) is not supported yet$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C %%call void @trith_arr_free(ptr {a}, i64 {#lv})%% ‹eemit›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹eg_free› ⸫

⍝ ---- joins: phi nodes for every slot whose name differs between predecessors
⍝ An incoming edge is [label stack strand]; ins is a queue of them.

⦃ ⧖:C,lb,S,st ⧗:C ‹len› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C ⧗:lb ⍆̵ ⧗:S ⍆̵ ⧗:st ⍆̵ ⧗:r ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹einc› ⸫
⍝ ‹eincadd› C ins lb S st
⦃ ⧖:C,ins,lb,S,st ⧗:C,lb,S,st ‹einc› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C,ins,r ‹qadd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹eincadd› ⸫

⍝ ‹ephi› C ins key j f lt: a phi over field f (1 v, 2 ok) of entry j of each edge's key (1 stack, 2 strand)
⦃
  ⧖:C,ins,key,j,f,lt
  ⧗:C,ins ‹qlist› ⧖:C,L
  ⧗:C,L ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,i0
  ⧗:C,i0,key ‹vf› ⧖:C,l0 ⧗:C,l0,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,e0 ⧗:C,e0,f ‹vf› ⧖:C,v0
  ⧗:C ‹qnew› ⧖:C,arms ⧗:C ‹qnew› ⧖:C,seen
  ⧗:C,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,L,key,j,f,v0,arms,seen ○ ⧗:n ⦶
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,key,j,f,v0,arms,seen,i,n,same
    ⧗:C,L,key,j,f,v0,arms,seen,i,n,same ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹ephi1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,L,key,j,f,v0,arms,seen,i,n,same
  ⧗:C,v0,arms,lt ⧗:same ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:vv,a,l ⧗:a ○ ‹qjoin› ⧖:at %%phi {l} {at}%% ‹edef› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ephi› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,L,key,j,f,v0,arms,seen,i,n,same
  ⧗:C,L,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,inc
  ⧗:C,inc,key ‹vf› ⧖:C,li ⧗:C,li,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,ei ⧗:C,ei,f ‹vf› ⧖:C,vi
  ⧗:C,inc ‹rd› ⧖:C,lb
  ⧗:C,seen,lb ‹qhas› ⧖:C,had
  ⧗:C,arms,seen,lb,vi ⧗:had ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:a,s,l,v ⧗:s,l ‹qadd› %%[ {v}, %{l} ]%% ⧖:arm ⧗:a,arm ‹qadd› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:L,key,j,f,v0,arms,seen ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:same ⧗:vi ⧗:v0 ᛖ ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ⟩ ‹ephi1› ⸫

⍝ ‹emerge› C ins key m: a phi (where needed) for every entry of the list m
⦃
  ⧖:C,ins,key,m
  ⧗:C ‹qnew› ⧖:C,out
  ⧗:C,m ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,ins,key,m,out ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,ins,key,m,out,j,n
    ⧗:C,ins,key,m,out,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹emerge1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:out ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:out ‹qlist›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹emerge› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,ins,key,m,out,j,n
  ⧗:C,m,j ‹lget› ‹ety› ⧖:C,ty
  ⧗:C,ty ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C ⧗:h #968# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #-1# ‹eerr› $s1 keeps superpositions inside one block: a ψ cannot flow through ⋔, ⁇ or ⥀ (collapse it first)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C,ty ‹evty› ⧖:C,vt
  ⧗:C,ins,key,j,vt ⧗:vt #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:i,k,jj,t ⧗:i,k,jj △ ⧗:t ‹ephi› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C,ty ‹efailty› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C #45# ‹etx› ⧖:C,i1
  ⧗:C,ins,key,j,i1 ⧗:f ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:i,k,jj,t ⧗:i,k,jj #2# ⧗:t ‹ephi› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,ok
  ⧗:C,ty,v,ok ‹ent› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C,out,e ‹qadd›
  ⧗:ins,key,m,out ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹emerge1› ⸫

⍝ ‹ejoin› C ins join: the join label and its phis, giving S strand dead
⦃
  ⧖:C,ins,join
  ⧗:C,join ‹estart›
  ⧗:ins #2# ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,ins ⧗:n ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ %%unreachable%% ‹eemit› ‹lnew0› ⧖:e ⧗:e,e △ ⦄ ⦃ ‹ejoin1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹ejoin› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,ins
  ⧗:C,ins ‹qlist› ⧖:C,L
  ⧗:C,L ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,i0
  ⧗:C,i0 △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,s0
  ⧗:C,ins △ ⧗:s0 ‹emerge› ⧖:C,S
  ⍝ exported moments: the longest common prefix of the moment types
  ⧗:C,i0 #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,t0
  ⧗:C,t0 ‹llen› ⧖:C,p
  ⧗:C,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,L,t0 △ ⧗:n,p
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,t0,i,n,p
    ⧗:C,L,t0,i,n,p ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,L,t0,i,n,p ⧗:C,L,i ‹lget› #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,si ⧗:C,t0,si,p ‹eprefix› ⧖:C,p2 ⧗:C,L,t0 ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n,p2 ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,L,t0,i,n,p
  ⧗:C,t0 ○ ⧗:p ‹lslice› ⧖:C,proto
  ⧗:C,ins #2# ⧗:proto ‹emerge› ⧖:C,strand
  ⧗:C,S,strand ○
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹ejoin1› ⸫
⍝ ‹eprefix› C a b p: how many of the first p entries of a and b have the same types
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,p
  ⧗:C,b ‹llen› ⧖:C,nb
  ⧗:p ⧗:nb ‹min› ⧖:lim
  ⧗:C,a,b,lim ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,a,b,lim,q
    ⧗:C,a,b,lim,q ⧗:q ⧗:lim ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹eprefix1› ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,a,b,lim,q ⧗:C,q
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eprefix› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,lim,q
  ⧗:C,a,q ‹lget› ‹ety› ⧖:C,ta ⧗:C,b,q ‹lget› ‹ety› ⧖:C,tb
  ⧗:C,a,b,lim,q ⧗:ta ⧗:tb ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ⟩ ‹eprefix1› ⸫

⍝ ---- three-way branches
⍝ ‹ebranch3› C c t0 t1 t2: branch on trit entry c to t0 (⦶), t1 (⊕), t2 (⊖); the edges [from to] as a
⍝ queue. A trit fresh from ≶ branches on the comparison itself, so LLVM sees the compares C would use.

⦃ ⧖:C,ed,from,to ⧗:C ‹len› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C ⧗:from ⍆̵ ⧗:to ⍆̵ ⧖:C ⧗:C,ed,r ‹qadd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹eedge› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,c,t0,t1,t2
  ⧗:C ‹ecur› ⧖:C,from
  ⧗:C ‹qnew› ⧖:C,ed
  ⧗:C,c #10# ‹vf› ⧖:C,cmp
  ⧗:C,c,t0,t1,t2,from,ed ⧗:cmp #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ebr3s› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ebr3c› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:ed
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ebranch3› ⸫
⍝ a switch on the trit; one case per distinct target, since a phi lists each predecessor once
⦃
  ⧖:C,c,t0,t1,t2,from,ed
  ⧗:C,c ‹ev› ⧖:C,cv
  ⧗:t0 ⧗:t1 ᛖ ⧖:e01 ⧗:t0 ⧗:t2 ᛖ ⧖:e02 ⧗:t1 ⧗:t2 ᛖ ⧖:e12
  #4# ⧗:e02 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:e01 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:e01 ⧗:e12 ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:e02 ‹not› ⧗:e12 ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:e01 ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:k
  ⧗:C,cv,t0,t1,t2,k
  ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:v,a,b,d %%switch i8 {v}, label %{d} [ i8 0, label %{a}  i8 1, label %{b} ]%% ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:v,a,b,d %%br label %{a}%% ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:v,a,b,d %%switch i8 {v}, label %{a} [ i8 -1, label %{d} ]%% ⦄ ⦃
  #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:v,a,b,d %%switch i8 {v}, label %{d} [ i8 1, label %{b} ]%% ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:v,a,b,d %%switch i8 {v}, label %{d} [ i8 0, label %{a} ]%% ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
  ‹eemit› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C,ed,from,t0 ‹eedge› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C,ed,from,t1 ⧗:e01 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹eedge› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C,ed,from,t2 ⧗:e02 ⧗:e12 ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹eedge› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebr3s› ⸫
⍝ branches on the comparison that made the trit
⦃
  ⧖:C,c,t0,t1,t2,from,ed
  ⧗:C,c #10# ‹vf› ⧖:C,cmp
  ⧗:C,cmp ○ ‹vf› ⧖:C,eq ⧗:C,cmp △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,gt ⧗:C,cmp #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,lt ⧗:C,cmp #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,a ⧗:C,cmp #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,b
  #4# ⧗:t0 ⧗:t2 ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:t1 ⧗:t2 ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:t0 ⧗:t1 ᛖ ⧗:t1 ⧗:t2 ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:k
  ⧗:C,t0,t1,t2,from,ed,eq,gt,lt,a,b,k
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹ebc1› ⦄ ⦃ ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹ebc2› ⦄ ⦃ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ebc3› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ebc4› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebr3c› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,t0,t1,t2,from,ed,eq,gt,lt,a,b
  ⧗:C,t0 ‹ebr› ⧗:ed,from,t0 ‹eedge›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebc1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,t0,t1,t2,from,ed,eq,gt,lt,a,b
  ⧗:C %%{eq} {lt} {a}, {b}%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,ce
  ⧗:C,ce,t0,t1 ‹ebr2› ⧗:ed,from,t0 ‹eedge› ⧗:ed,from,t1 ‹eedge›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebc2› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,t0,t1,t2,from,ed,eq,gt,lt,a,b
  ⧗:C %%{gt} {lt} {a}, {b}%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,cg
  ⧗:C,cg,t1,t0 ‹ebr2› ⧗:ed,from,t1 ‹eedge› ⧗:ed,from,t0 ‹eedge›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebc3› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,t0,t1,t2,from,ed,eq,gt,lt,a,b
  ⧗:C ‹elabel› ⧖:C,lne
  ⧗:C %%{eq} {lt} {a}, {b}%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,ce
  ⧗:C,ce,t0,lne ‹ebr2› ⧗:lne ‹estart› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C %%{gt} {lt} {a}, {b}%% ‹edef› ⧖:C,cg
  ⧗:C,cg,t1,t2 ‹ebr2› ⧗:ed,from,t0 ‹eedge› ⧗:ed,lne,t1 ‹eedge› ⧗:ed,lne,t2 ‹eedge›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebc4› ⸫

⍝ ---- blocks: ‹eblock› C from to S → C S strand dead (dead: 1 when the block left by failure)

⍝ ‹efind› C name: the emit record of a function
⦃
  ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C #36# ‹reg› ‹rd› ⧖:C,nd
  ⧗:C,name,nd #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,name,nd,found
    ⧗:C,name,nd,found ⧗:found #-1# ᛖ ⧗:nd #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔
      ⦃ ⧖:C,name,nd,found ⧗:C ⧗:nd △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C,r ‹rd› ⧖:C,rn ⧗:C,nd ‹rd› ⧖:C,nx
        ⧗:C,name,nx ⧗:found ⧗:r ⧗:rn ⧗:name ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,name,nd,found ⧗:C,found
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹efind› ⸫
⍝ ‹eresolve› C op: the emit record of the function a call node names
⦃ ⧖:C,op ⧗:C,op ‹resolve› ‹rd› ‹efind› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eresolve› ⸫

⍝ ‹esub› C from to S: run the ops in their own future-call frame
⦃
  ⧖:C,from,to,S
  ⧗:C ‹epushf›
  ⧗:from,to,S ‹eblock› ⧖:C,R,st,dead
  ⧗:C ‹epopf› ⧖:C,q
  ⧗:C,q ⧗:dead ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹erunf› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:R,st,dead
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹esub› ⸫
⍝ ‹esubb› C b S: ‹esub› on the ops of block node b
⦃ ⧖:C,b,S ⧗:C,b ‹brange› ⧖:C,from,to ⧗:C,from,to,S ‹esub› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹esubb› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,from,to,S
  ⧗:C ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,strand
  ⍝ the loop carries [C oi to S strand dead prev]
  ⧗:C,from,to,S,strand ○ #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,oi,to,S,strand,dead,prev
    ⧗:C,oi,to,S,strand,dead,prev ⧗:oi ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹estep› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,oi,to,S,strand,dead,prev
  ⧗:C,S,strand,dead
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹eblock› ⸫

⍝ ‹estep› C oi to S strand dead prev: one op
⦃
  ⧖:C,oi,to,S,strand,dead,prev
  ⧗:C,oi,S,strand,dead,prev,to ‹ecase› ⧖:C,S2,strand2,dead2,skip
  ⧗:C,oi ‹nextn› ⧖:C,nx
  ⧗:C,nx ‹nextn› ⧖:C,nx2
  ⧗:nx ⧗:nx2 ⧗:skip △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:oi2
  ⧗:oi ⧗:nx ⧗:skip △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:prev2
  ⧗:C,oi2,to,S2,strand2,dead2,prev2
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹estep› ⸫

⍝ ‹ecase› C op S strand dead prev to → C S strand dead skip
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,S,strand,dead,prev,to
  ⧗:C,op ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C,op,S,strand,dead,prev,to,k
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹el_lit› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⍿¹ #6# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹el_call› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹el_op› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #18# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹el_op› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #10# #11# ᛦ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹el_select› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #14# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹el_loop› ⦄ ⦃
