⍝ ‹ebytelits› C uv n x: integer literals among the operands become bytes (literals are gluons, §3.2)
⦃
  ⧖:C,uv,n,x
  ⧗:C,uv,x ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,uv,x,i,n
    ⧗:C,uv,x,i,n ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹ebytelit1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
