  ⧖:C,uv,x,i,n
  ⧗:C,uv,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,ue
  ⧗:C,ue ‹ety› #11# ‹tis› ⧖:C,isz
  ⧗:C,ue #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,lit
  ⧗:isz ⧗:lit △ ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:x #9032# ᛖ ⧗:i △ ᛖ ⋎ ‹not› ⋎ ⧖:conv
  ⧗:C,uv,i,ue ⧗:conv ⋔ ⦃ ‹ebytelit2› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
