⍝ ‹eexact› n: n is within the exact range of compile-time evaluation (|n| ≤ 2⁵³)
⦃ ⧖:n ⧗:n #9007199254740992# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:n #-9007199254740992# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹eexact› ⸫
⍝ ‹emulok› a b: |a·b| ≤ 2⁵³, decided without overflow
⦃
  ⧖:a,b
  ⧗:a ⧗:a ○ ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ ⊝ ⦄ ⧖:aa ⧗:b ⧗:b ○ ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ ⊝ ⦄ ⧖:bb
  ⧗:aa,bb ⧗:aa ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹emulok1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹emulok› ⸫
